  <div class="model-sheetbody"><div class="model-addgrid" id="modelAddGrid"></div><p class="model-note" style="margin:10px 2px 6px">组合预设（每个部件可单独编辑）</p><div class="model-presetrow" id="modelPresetRow"></div><button type="button" class="model-importrow" id="modelImportBtn2">⇪ 导入模型文件（OBJ / GLB / STL）</button><input type="file" id="modelImportInput" accept=".obj,.glb,.gltf,.stl" hidden><p class="model-note">添加后切到「移动 / 旋转 / 缩放」拖彩色轴；「编辑」里可以拖顶点、多选面挤出/内插/删面。导入的模型会自动缩放到合适大小。</p></div>
 </div>
 <div class="model-sheet" data-sheet="props">
  <div class="model-sheethead"><strong>属性</strong><button type="button" aria-label="关闭">✕</button></div>
  <div class="model-sheetbody"><div class="model-props" id="modelPropsBody"></div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="model-sheet" data-sheet="scene">
  <div class="model-sheethead"><strong>场景物体</strong><button type="button" aria-label="关闭">✕</button></div>
  <div class="model-sheetbody"><div id="modelSceneBody"></div><div class="model-propactions" style="margin-top:10px"><button type="button" id="modelMergeBtn">⊕ 合并为一个</button><button type="button" id="modelSceneExportBtn">⇩ 导出工程</button><button type="button" id="modelSceneImportBtn">⇪ 导入工程</button></div><input type="file" id="modelSceneInput" accept=".tgscene,.json" hidden><p class="model-note">「合并为一个」把所有物体烘成单一网格（修改器会先固化）；工程文件（.tgscene）保存整个场景，可备份或发给别人，导入会替换当前场景，可撤销。</p></div>
 </div>
 <div class="model-sheet" data-sheet="export">
  <div class="model-sheethead"><strong>导出模型</strong><button type="button" aria-label="关闭">✕</button></div>
  <div class="model-sheetbody">
   <div class="model-exportlist">
    <button type="button" data-export="glb"><strong>GLB（推荐）</strong><small>带材质颜色，Blender / 网页 / 3D 查看器都能打开</small></button>
